root agent.","language","en","来源核查","2026-10-18","verified","section","metadata","年份","2025","year","list","适用方向","ordered",false,[84,85],"dimensions","3D","世界模型","开发阶段",[85],"stages","主题",[92,93,94,95,96,97],"tags","interactive-video","neural-simulator","action-control","Minecraft","dataset","ICCV-2025","延伸阅读",[100,101],{"_56":104,"_25":62},{"_56":102,"_25":103},"GF-Minecraft dataset","https://huggingface.co/datasets/KlingTeam/GameFactory-Dataset","Dataset tools and documentation","项目源码",[107],{"_56":105,"_25":108},"https://arxiv.org/abs/2501.08325","用途与特点","通过领域适配器与动作控制模块生成自回归游戏视频。公开 GF-Minecraft 数据集包含动作标签，所检查仓库提供数据说明、检测和可视化工具，但未确立完整训练、推理流程或权重已发布。视觉泛化应与规则正确性、物品持续性及可导出游戏项目分别评估。","detail","guidance","资源类型","论文","分类","category","lead","summary","name","world","paper",[128,129],[92,93,94,95,96,97],[120],[127,120],2025,"3d",{"_56":104,"_25":62},{"_56":102,"_25":103},{"_131":132},"documents",{"_69":133,"_35":134},[136,140,141,142,139,143,144,145,146,147,148,149,150,151,152,153,154,155,156,157,158,159,160,161,162,163,164,165,166,167,168,169,170,171,172,173,174,138,175,137,176,177,178,179,180,181,182,183,184,185,186,187,188,189,190,191,192,193,194,195,196],[135,136,137,138,139],"reading-guide","practical-guide","level-design-skill","deployment","publishing-platforms","tutorials-and-demos","coding-agent-game-code","game-testing-library","agents-notes","engines-notes","game-ai-notes","cadle-repositories","world-model-notes","research-index","production-research-notes","engine-operation-contracts","production-work-orders","studio-production-case-studies","native-operation-details","production-debugging-contracts","production-coverage-gaps","generative-tools-research","generative-api-boundaries","generation-delivery-contracts","asset-validation-contracts","asset-selection-feedback","visual-evidence-research","visual-feedback-mechanisms","game-development-evaluation","benchmark-reproducibility","gameplay-state-contracts","agent-interface-evidence","catalog-review-coverage","so